Inspect `.tex` files, not compiled English PDFs.

Terminology:

- Ability: Bio-Toxin
- Ability: Spore-Mine. Weapon name: Spore-Mines. One object in prose: Spore-Mine
- Rules range: Synapse radius (matches Synapse (X cm)). Hive Mind is lore and Hive Mind Test
- To-Hit everywhere, including table headers
- Assault only in ability names; otherwise assault
- Instinct for the mechanic; Instinct counter, not token
- orders in running text; Orders only for the phase step or counter type
- Hive Mind Test
